        "text": "Kara Swisher adds DOGE's \"Big Balls\" to the Democrat target list.\n\n\"They could just pick a few people. To me, that's the way you go. You pick like a Hegseth, a Musk, and I don't know, Big Balls.\"\n\n\"Rather than go for Trump, go for everybody.\"\n\n\"Make it so broad that exhausts people who just do want to move on.\"\n\nThey're now just casually naming random people that did things they didn't like.\n\nThe ever-growing investigation wishlist now includes Trump family, donors, friends, supporters, allies and DOGE employees.\n\nAnd it won't stop there.",
