    {
      "id": "2116161085262954838",
      "author": "elonmusk",
      "author_name": "Elon Musk",
      "author_avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2053244804520427520/m8mdWZCG_200x200.jpg",
      "author_verified": true,
      "author_verified_type": "individual",
      "created_at_utc": "2026-10-30T13:31:33.000Z",
      "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-30 21:31:33",
      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "🎯🎯 this is why sitting out this midterm to “stick it to Trump” is dangerous and idiotic.",
      "quote": {
        "author": "elonmusk",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2103567689515954176/aR-Kjpp4_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-30 13:28:57",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-10-30T05:28:57.000Z",
        "id": "2116039632743702637",
        "images": [],
        "media": [],
        "name": "Elon Musk",
        "text": "My biggest concern is that if there is a clean sweep by Democrats of the House, Senate and Presidency in 2028, they will:\n\n1. Make DC and Puerto Rico states to gain a strong majority in the Senate. \n\n2. Open the borders and legalize everyone living in America illegally to cement a permanent majority.\n\n3. Increase the size of the Supreme Court to gain an immediate majority. \n\nThis would result in America becoming a permanent one-party state and the end of democracy in any meaningful sense of the word.\n\nAll that is needed to ensure this doesn’t happen is 51 Republican senators in 2029. That is why you should vote for Republican senators this election. Other reasons are irrelevant compared to this one.",
        "url": "https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2116039632743702637",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
      "retweet": {
        "author": "the_jefferymead",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1653093448822542336/eMRq3ayO_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-30 20:22:45",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-10-30T12:22:45.000Z",
        "id": "2116143771561918585",
        "images": [],
        "media": [],
        "name": "Jeffery Mead",
        "text": "🎯🎯 this is why sitting out this midterm to “stick it to Trump” is dangerous and idiotic.",
        "url": "https://x.com/the_jefferymead/status/2116143771561918585",
