      "type": "引用",
      "type_label": "引用",
      "text": "California became a one-party state",
      "quote": {
        "author": "ArthurMacwaters",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1921033752140279808/TgndOxdb_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-30 14:25:50",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-10-30T06:25:50.000Z",
        "id": "2116053951049273711",
        "images": [
          "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HV26fw8bsAA9Wqk.jpg?name=small"
        ],
        "media": [
          {
            "height": 1360,
            "type": "photo",
            "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HV26fw8bsAA9Wqk.jpg?name=small",
            "width": 1060
          }
        ],
        "name": "Arthur MacWaters",
        "text": "In 1986, Ronald Reagan allowed ~1.4m illegal immigrants in California to become citizens\n\n1988 was the last time California voted Republican, ever. \n\nElon's caution about opening borders and creating voting pathways is *the literal playbook* and has already been done once\n\nIf politicians can win elections by altering demographics (including by importing or creating more voters for their party) the entire premise of the American system is permanently broken \n\nThis is a far more important issue than any individual issue on the ballot",
        "url": "https://x.com/ArthurMacwaters/status/2116053951049273711",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
      "retweet": null,
      "reply_to": "",
      "engagement": {
        "bookmarks": 660,
        "likes": 21291,
        "quotes": 122,
        "replies": 1079,
        "retweets": 2910,
        "views": 1524895
      },
      "url": "https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2116160860599226657",
      "images": [],
      "media": [],
      "enriched": true
    },
