    {
      "id": "2116044193302806831",
      "author": "elonmusk",
      "author_name": "Elon Musk",
      "author_avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2053244804520427520/m8mdWZCG_200x200.jpg",
      "author_verified": true,
      "author_verified_type": "individual",
      "created_at_utc": "2026-10-30T05:47:04.000Z",
      "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-30 13:47:04",
      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "BACK HOME IN TEXAS! 🇺🇸\n\nI was raised in a small Texas town where faith, family, hard work, and freedom weren’t just words — they were a way of life. Those values shaped who I am, and they’re worth fighting to preserve.\n\nHonored to join Vice President @JDVance and @KenPaxtonTX as we fight for the future of our great state and country.\n\nOne of the most special parts of today was having my mom, Texas State Representative Helen Kerwin, and my sister Helen in the audience. My mom raised three daughters with an unwavering faith in God, a strong work ethic, and a deep love for this country. To have her there today, serving the very Texas communities that raised us, was a full-circle moment I will never forget.\n\nWe’re fighting to secure our borders, bring American jobs home, strengthen our communities, and restore the American Dream.\n\nBut this is about more than politics. It’s about protecting the freedoms we inherited and ensuring our children and grandchildren have the same opportunity to live, work, raise a family, and pursue their dreams.\n\nThe Glen Rose, Texas values that raised me are the American values we will never stop defending. It is an honor to MEET THIS MOMENT. \n\nGOD BLESS TEXAS! GOD BLESS AMERICA!",
      "quote": null,
      "retweet": {
        "author": "BrookeLRollins",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1906183826109284352/9J9DHZO8_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-30 08:05:01",
